      "message": "test(bore): move two law fixtures inside the bore limit; name the core as a band\n\ncenter_cut_law and level_links bored a 20 mm hole with a 6 mm tool\n(3.33 d), a ride that left a 6-8 mm floor ring uncut; they now bore\n16 mm. The refusal names the uncut core by both diameters (the dive\nclears its middle).\n\nRefs #1556\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
